      "成人常用劑量說明": "IV. \r\r\nMetastatic breast cancer, Following failure of combination chemotherapy: 260 mg/m2 IV over 30 minutes every 3 weeks.\r\r\nNon-small cell lung cancer, Advanced or metastatic, first-line treatment, in combination with carboplatin:100 mg/m2 IV over 30 minutes on days 1, 8, and 15 of each 21-day cycle. Pancreatic cancer, Metastatic, adenocarcinoma, first-line treatment, in combination with gemcitabine: Paclitaxel protein-bound 125 mg/m(2) IV over 30 to 40 minutes on days 1, 8, and 15 of each 28-day cycle; followed immediately by gemcitabine  1000 mg/m(2) IV infusion over 30 to 40 minutes  on days 1, 8, and 15 of each 28-day cycle; continued until disease progression or unacceptable toxicity",
