      "藥品手冊適應症": "Treatment of acetaminophen overdose",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "IVD. (21-hour regimen) >40kg: Loading dose 150 mg/kg (Max: 15 g) in 200 mL of compatible solution (D5W, 0.45%NaCl or Water for inj.) over 60 minutes; Second dose 50 mg/kg (Max: 5 g) in 500 mL compatible solution over 4 hours; Third dose 100 mg/kg (Max: 10 g) in 1000 mL compatible solution over 16 hours.\r\r\nThe fluid volume should be reduced in patients weighing <40 kg: \r\r\nBody Weight\tLoading volume\tSecond volume\tThird volume\r\r\n21-40 kg\t100 mL\t\t250 mL\t\t500 mL\r\r\n5-20 kg\t\t3 mL/kg\t\t7 mL/kg\t\t14 mL/kg",
