      "成分及含量": "Alteplase (rt-PA) 50 mg/Vial 栓體舒注射液 \r\r\neach Vial：alteplase = recombinant human tissue-type plasminogen activator\t50 mg. \r\r\nevery Vial of solvent：water for injection 50 mL. \r\r\nSolution after preparation: alteplase 1 mg/mL.",
      "藥品手冊適應症": "Acute coronary artery thrombosis, acute ischemic stroke, acute pulmonary embolism.",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "IV only. Acute myocardial infarction, 90-minute infusion:- 15 mg bolus over 1-2 mins, then 0.75 mg/kg (not to exceed 50 mg) over next 30 mins, followed by 0.5 mg/kg (not to exceed 35 mg) over next 60 mins, total dose not to exceed 100 mg.\r\r\nAcute ischemic stroke - 0.9 mg/kg over 60 min. Max. 90 mg.\r\r\nPulmonary embolism (PE)- 100 mg administered by IV infusion over 2 hrs.\r\r\nPE - Catheter-directed thrombolysis, intra-catheter(may be performed with EKOS): clinical trials Low-dose continuous infusion range: 0.5-2 mg/hour. (off-label use, optimal regimens and doses have not been identified).",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "I.V, Arterial thrombosis: 0.1-0.6 mg/kg/hour for 6 hours. (micromedex)",
      "貯藏方式": "未開封:＜30℃, 避免過多光線照射。\r\r\n開封後儲存條件：配製後:2-8℃下24小時，30℃下可放8小時。",
      "用藥方法": "1.配製：以50毫升注射用水加入乾粉瓶中，輕輕旋轉使其溶解，避免產生泡沫。形成濃度為1毫克/毫升。\r\r\n2.稀釋：可使用0.9%食鹽水進一步稀釋，但濃度不可小於0.2毫克/毫升。不可使用注射用水或葡萄糖液稀釋，以免產生不可逆的混濁。\r\r\n3.開始給藥15 mg 1-2 分鐘完成快速滴注。接著0.75 mg/kg(最多不超過50mg) 滴注30分鐘。接著0.5 mg/kg(最多不超過35mg) 滴注60分鐘。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.血管性水腫是ACTILYSE最常見的過敏反應。在急性缺血性中風和/或ACE抑製劑的合併治療中，這種風險可能會增加。在輸注期間和輸注後24小時內，應監測血管性水腫。如果發生嚴重過敏反應應停止輸注，並立即採取適當的治療措施，包含插管。",
