      "中文名稱": "采視明瓶裝注射液",
      "商品名稱": "Eylea 40mg/mL 0.05mL/Vial",
      "成分及含量": "Aflibercept 40 mg/mL, 0.05 mL/Vial 采視明瓶裝注射液",
      "藥品手冊適應症": "Neovascular (wet) age-related macular degeneration (AMD); visual impairment due to macular edema secondary to central retinal vein occlusion (CRVO), visual impairment due to diabetic macular edema(DME), visual impairment due to macular edema secondary to branch retinal vein occlusion (BRVO), visual impairment due to choroidal neovascularization (CNV) secondary to pathological myopia(PM).",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "Intravitreal inj. \r\r\n1.Age-related macular degeneration (AMD): 2 mg (0.05 mL) every 4 weeks for 3 doses then every 8 weeks thereafter.\r\r\n2.Macular edema following retinal vein occlusion (BRVO or CRVO): 2 mg (0.05 mL) every 4 weeks.\r\r\n3.Diabetic macular edema: Initial 2 mg (0.05 mL) every 4 weeks for 5 doses, then 2 mg (0.05 mL) every 8 weeks.\r\r\n4.Choroidal neovascularization in pathological myopia: 2 mg (0.05 mL) once. May give additional dose if necessary. The interval between injections into the same eyeball should be ≧1 month.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "Retinopathy of prematurity (ROP): Preterm neonates: Intravitreal injection: 0.4 mg (0.01 mL) as a single injection in the affected eye(s); may repeat dose after a minimum interval of 10 days.",
      "貯藏方式": "開封前應存於原包裝盒內避光，且於冷藏2-8℃保存，不可冷凍。未開封的藥品可在室溫25℃下存放24小時。",
      "用藥方法": "1.在無菌狀態的控制下進行玻璃體內注射過程，包括手術手部消毒，使用無菌手套、無菌手術單與無菌眼瞼擴張器(或類似品)。應在注射前給予適當麻醉與外用廣效殺菌劑。\r\r\n2.每個藥瓶僅可供單次使用。從單一玻璃藥瓶內抽出多次劑量可能會增加汙染與後續感染風險。由於藥瓶含有多於建議劑量(50微升)的體積(100微升)，抽取後，瓶內任何未使用的產品必須丟棄。",
      "特別用藥指示": "每個藥瓶僅供單次使用",
