      "商品名稱": "Blincyto 35mcg/Vial",
      "成分及含量": "Blinatumomab 35 mcg/Vial 百利妥注射劑\r\r\n1盒內包含: 1瓶35 mcg藥物與1瓶3 mL無菌水注射溶劑。",
      "藥品手冊適應症": "1.Acute lymphoblastic leukemia (B-cell precursor), minimal residual disease (MRD)-positive (≧0.1%). \r\r\n2.Acute lymphoblastic leukemia (B-cell precursor), relapsed/refractory.\r\r\n3.Precursor B-cell acute lymphoblastic leukemia, Philadelphia chromosome-negative, in the consolidation phase.",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "Continuous IV infusion.\r\r\n1.ALL (B-cell precursor): each cycle (total of up to 4 cycle):\r\r\nBW≧45kg: 28 mcg/day for 28 days followed by 2 weeks of no treatment. \r\r\nBW<45kg: 15 mcg/m(2)/day(max:28 mcg/day) for 28 days followed by 2 weeks of no treatment. \r\r\n*Premedicate with the IV equivalent to prednisone 100 mg or dexamethasone 16 mg IV one hour prior to the first dose of each cycle.\r\r\n2.ALL (B-cell precursor), relapsed/refractory (total of up to 9 cycle): \r\r\n(1)Cycle 1 (Induction): \r\r\nBW≧45kg: 9 mcg/day for 7 days, then 28 mcg/day from day8 to day28, followed by 2 weeks of no treatment. \r\r\nBW<45kg: 5 mcg/m(2)day (max:9 mcg/day) for 7 days, then 15 mcg/m(2)/day (max:28 mcg/day) from day8 to day28, followed by 2 weeks of no treatment.\r\r\n(2)Cycle 2 (Induction) and Cycle 3-5 (Consolidation), each cycle: \r\r\nBW≧45kg: 28 mcg/day for 28 days followed by 2 weeks of no treatment. BW<45kg: 15 mcg/m(2)/day(max:28 mcg/day) for 28 days followed by 2 weeks of no treatment. \r\r\n(3)Cycle 6-9 (Continued therapy), each cycle:\r\r\nBW≧45kg: 28 mcg/day for 28 days followed by 56 dsys of no treatment.\r\r\nBW<45kg: 15 mcg/m(2)/day(max:28 mcg/day) for 28 days followed by 56 days of no treatment.\r\r\n*Premedication, IV or PO dexamethasone 20 mg 1 hour before the first blinatumomab dose of each cycle, before a step dose (eg, cycle 1 day 8), and when restarting an infusion after an interruption of ≧4 hours.\r\r\n3.Precursor B-cell acute lymphoblastic leukemia, Philadelphia chromosome-negative, in the consolidation phase: \r\r\nBW≧45kg: 28 mcg/day for 28 days followed by 14 dsys of no treatment.\r\r\nBW<45kg: 15 mcg/m(2)/day(max:28 mcg/day) for 28 days followed by 14 days of no treatment.\r\r\n*Premedication, IV dexamethasone 20 mg 1 hour before the first blinatumomab dose of each cycle.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "Continuous IV infusion.\r\r\n1.ALL (B-cell precursor): each cycle (total of up to 4 cycle):\r\r\nBW≧45kg: 28 mcg/day for 28 days followed by 2 weeks of no treatment. \r\r\nBW<45kg: 15 mcg/m(2)/day(max:28 mcg/day) for 28 days followed by 2 weeks of no treatment. \r\r\n*Premedicate with the IV or Oral dexamethasone 5mg/m(2) (max: 20mg) prior to the 1st dose of cycle 1 and when restarting an infusion after interruption of ≧4 hours in the first cycle.\r\r\n2.ALL (B-cell precursor), relapsed/refractory (total of up to 9 cycle): \r\r\n(1)Cycle 1 (Induction): \r\r\nBW≧45kg: 9 mcg/day for 7 days, then 28 mcg/day from day8 to day28, followed by 2 weeks of no treatment. \r\r\nBW<45kg: 5 mcg/m(2)day (max:9 mcg/day) for 7 days, then 15 mcg/m(2)/day (max:28 mcg/day) from day8 to day28, followed by 2 weeks of no treatment.\r\r\n(2)Cycle 2 (Induction) and Cycle 3-5 (Consolidation), each cycle: \r\r\nBW≧45kg: 28 mcg/day for 28 days followed by 2 weeks of no treatment. BW<45kg: 15 mcg/m(2)/day(max:28 mcg/day) for 28 days followed by 2 weeks of no treatment. \r\r\n(3)Cycle 6-9 (Continued therapy), each cycle:\r\r\nBW≧45kg: 28 mcg/day for 28 days followed by 56 dsys of no treatment.\r\r\nBW<45kg: 15 mcg/m(2)/day(max:28 mcg/day) for 28 days followed by 56 days of no treatment.\r\r\n*Premedication with IV or Oral dexamethasone 5mg/m(2) (max: 20mg)  1 hour before the 1st blinatumomab dose of 1st cycle, before a step dose (eg, cycle 1 day 8), and when restarting an infusion after an interruption of ≧4 hours in the first cycle.\r\r\n3.Precursor B-cell acute lymphoblastic leukemia, Philadelphia chromosome-negative, in the consolidation phase: \r\r\nBW≧45kg:  28 mcg/day for 28 days followed by 14 dsys of no treatment.\r\r\nBW<45kg: 15 mcg/m(2)/day(max:28 mcg/day) for 28 days followed by 14 days of no treatment.\r\r\n*Premedication, IV or Oral dexamethasone 5mg/m(2) (max: 20mg) before the 1st blinatumomab dose of 1st cycle and when restarting an infusion after an interruption of ≧4 hours in the first cycle.",
      "貯藏方式": "未開封:2-8℃.\r\r\n開封後儲存條件：小瓶重組後最長存放時間: 室溫(23-27℃)4小時；冷藏(2-8℃)24小時。\r\r\n調配好之輸液袋最長存放時間: 室溫(23-27℃)96小時；冷藏(2-8℃)10天。",
      "用藥方法": "1.應以連續靜脈輸注給藥，並使用輸注幫浦維持固定流速，此幫浦應可設定控制、可鎖定、非合成橡膠製成並附有警鈴裝置。\r\r\n2.以 10 mL/h 的輸注速率在 24 小時期間內輸注完畢，或以 5 mL/h 的輸注速率在 48 小時期間內輸注完畢。\r\r\n3.每盒內含 1瓶藥物與 1瓶IV溶液穩定劑。配製方式:\r\r\n(1) 每小瓶使用3 mL無防腐劑無菌注射用水重組本藥(重組後濃度12.5mcg/mL)，切勿用 IV 溶液穩定劑來重組本藥。\r\r\n(2)將270mL NS 注入空的IV 袋，取5.5mL IV溶液穩定劑加入此IV袋中，輕輕混合並避免起泡。\r\r\n    此穩定劑會在預充填 IV 袋內形成塗層，可防止本藥沾黏在 IV 袋與 IV 管線上。\r\r\n(3)將所需容量的重組後本藥溶液注入含NS 和IV溶液穩定劑的IV袋。輕輕地混合IV 袋中溶液避免起泡。\r\r\n(4)在無菌環境下，將 IV 管線與裝有孔徑 0.2 微米無菌?管線過濾器的 IV 袋連結起來。確定 IV 管線與輸注幫浦相容。\r\r\n(5)排出 IV 袋內空氣。尤其在使用可攜式輸注幫浦時。\r\r\n(6)只能用含有最終調配後本藥輸注溶液袋中的溶液來充滿 IV 管線。不可用NS來充滿管線。\r\r\n4.本藥與di?ethylhexylphthalate (DEHP) 可能會形成顆粒，而導致溶液起霧，因此不相容。應選擇使用DEHP?free的 PVC 或 EVA 材質的 IV 管線組、輸注袋、幫浦卡匣。若溶液起霧或有沉澱，切勿使用。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1. 給予Blinatumomab溶液時，應使用含有無菌的、無致熱原、低蛋白結合且孔徑為0.2 micron 管內過濾器的 IV 管線。\r\r\n2.不要沖洗Blinatumomab輸液管線或靜脈導管，尤其在更換輸液袋時。更換輸液袋或\r\r\n輸注完畢時沖洗管線可能造成給予過多劑量而產生併發症。\r\r\n3.若發生下列症狀，請告知您的醫護人員或就醫:細胞激素釋放症候群(如發燒、疲倦、虛弱、頭暈、頭痛、低血壓、噁心、嘔吐、寒顫、臉部腫脹、呼吸困難或皮疹)及神經問題(如癲癇、言語困難、喪失意識、意識混亂和失去方向感或平衡感、睡眠障礙、頭痛、臉部動作或吞嚥障礙、聽力或視力障礙等)。基於可能發生的副作用，不建議於治療期間開車、操作重型機械或從事危險活動。\r\r\n4.若出現任何感染相關症狀或嚴重且持續的胃部疼痛(可能伴隨噁心嘔吐)請告知您的醫護人員。\r\r\n5.在接受Blinatumomab治療期間及直到治療結束48小時內，都應採取有效的避孕法，哺乳婦於這期間內亦應避免哺乳。\r\r\n6.在開始Blinatumomab治療前至少2週、還有治療期間，直到最後一週期Blinatumomab給藥後，回復免疫功能之前，都不建議接種活性病毒疫苗。",
      "健保價格": "56273",
