      "藥品手冊適應症": "Glioblastoma multiforme of brain, Recurrent; as an adjunct to surgery, Hodgkin's disease, Relapsed or refractory, in combination with other approved agents.Intracranial tumor, Malignant, Malignant glioma - Neoplasm of brain stem, Malignant glioma of brain, High-grade, newly diagnosed; adjunct to surgery and radiation, Multiple myeloma, In combination with prednisone or other established combination therapy, Non-Hodgkin's lymphoma, Relapsed or refractory, in combination with other approved agents",
