      "藥品手冊適應症": "Metastatic testicular tumors , metastatic ovarian tumors , advanced bladder \r\r\ncancer",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "For IV use only. Metastatic testicular tumor - 20 mg/m2/day IV for 5 days/cycle. \r\r\nMetastatic ovarian tumors - 75-100 mg/m2 once every 4 weeks/cycle.  \r\r\nAdvanced bladder cancer - 50-70 mg/m2/cycle once every 3-4 weeks.\r\r\nDosage adjustment：Platelet < 100,000, WBC < 4000 - do not use.\r\r\n\t\tOtotoxicity - do not use until recovered.\r\r\n\t\tgrade 3/4 nonhematologic toxicity - hold OR 50% of normal.\r\r\n\t\tDiarrhea - hold until resolution and 75% of normal.\r\r\n\t\tnadir ANC <500 OR nadir Platelet < 50,000 - 75% of normal.\r\r\n\t\tnadir Platelet < 50,000 with bleeding - 50% of normal.\r\r\n\t\tgrade 2 Neurotoxicity - 50% of normal.\r\r\n\t\tgrade 2 peripheral neuropathy - 80% of normal.\r\r\n\t\tgrade 3/4 Neurotoxicity - discontinue.\r\r\n\t\tgrade 3/4 nonhematologic toxicity - hold until recover and\r\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t75% of normal.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "TO PREVENT POSSIBLE OVERDOSE, VERIFY ANY CISPLATIN DOSE EXCEEDING 100 mg/m2 PER COURSE. Pretreatment hydration is recommended.\r\r\nGerm cell tumors: I.V.: Infants: 0.7 mg/kg/dose q3 weeks on days 1-5 in combination with bleomycin and etoposide (Cushing, 2004). Children and Adolescents: 20 mg/m2/dose q3 weeks on days 1-5 in combination with bleomycin and etoposide (Cushing, 2004) or 100 mg/m2 q3 weeks on day 1 in combination with bleomycin and vinblastine or etoposide (Pinkerton, 1986)\r\r\nHepatoblastoma: I.V.: <10 kg: 2.7 mg/kg IVD over 24 hours q3 weeks on day 1 in combination with doxorubicin for 4-6 cycles (Pritchard, 2000)\r\r\nChildren >10 kg and Adolescents: 80 mg/m2 continuous infusion over 24 hours q2 weeks on day 1; Combination therapy: 80 mg/m2 continuous infusion over 24 hours q3 weeks on day 1 in combination with doxorubicin (Perilongo, 2004; Perilongo, 2009; Pritchard, 2000).\r\r\nIntermittent infusion (over 6 hours): Infants and Children <10 kg: 3 mg/kg/dose given every 3 weeks on day 1 for 4-8 cycles in combination with vincristine and fluorouracil or continuous infusion doxorubicin (Douglass, 1993; Malogolowkin, 2008; Ortega, 2000)\r\r\nChildren >10 kg and Adolescents: 90 mg/m2/dose given every 3 weeks on day 1 for 4-8 cycles in combination with vincristine and fluorouracil or continuous infusion doxorubicin (Douglass, 1993; Malogolowkin, 2008; Ortega, 2000)\r\r\nMedulloblastoma: 75 mg/m2/dose q6 weeks on either day 0 in combination with vincristine and cyclophosphamide or day 1 in combination with lomustine and vincristine of each chemotherapy cycle for 8 cycles (Packer, 2006; Packer, 2013)\r\r\nNeuroblastoma, high-risk: I.V.: 50 mg/m2/day on days 0-3 q3 weeks in combination with etoposide (cycles 3 and 5) (Kreissman, 2013; Naranjo, 2011) or 50 mg/m2/day on days 1-4 in combination with etoposide (cycles 3, 5, and 7) (Kushner, 1994)\r\r\nOsteosarcoma: I.V.: 60 mg/m2/day for 2 days at weeks 2, 7, 25, and 28 (neoadjuvant) or weeks 5, 10, 25, and 28 (adjuvant) in combination with doxorubicin (Goorin, 2003) or 120 mg/m2/day at weeks 0, 5, 12, and 17 in combination with doxorubicin (Meyers, 2005)",
      "貯藏方式": "Do NOT refrigerate\r\r\n開封後儲存條件：避光保存。稀釋後保存：室溫(25℃)避光可保存72小時。",
      "用藥方法": "本品靜脈輸注前、中、後，皆需給予大量的生理食鹽水輸注，因此尿液會變多，以避免藥物造成腎臟的損傷。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.致吐性：高度致吐(有> 90%的病人會發生嘔吐)。常伴隨有延遲性嘔吐。2.因免疫力降低，可能增加感染的危險：通常白血球會在給藥後2-3週達到最低，之後緩解。如果有任何感染的症狀如發燒，打顫，喉嚨痛等，請盡速就醫。3.也會造成血小板減少及貧血的現象，要注意身上是否有小紫斑，或小出血點。可能會較容易感到疲勞。4.可能會有輕微掉髮(10%)、低血鎂(76%)或電解質不平衡。5.肝功能指數升高( 10%)。停藥可恢復。6.末梢神經病變(10%)，與劑量有關。需一段時間才會逐漸恢復。7.耳鳴(31%)或聽覺變差。與劑量或累積劑量有關且可能無法恢復。8.腎功能指數升高(28-36%)，嚴重時可能造成腎衰竭，與劑量或累積劑量有關。增加水份補充，可以降低腎功能指數升高的機率。9.過敏反應:臉部水腫、喘、心跳過速和低血壓。相同Platinum類化療藥物之間存在交叉過敏反應。",
      "健保價格": "350",
