      "兒童常用劑量說明": "2 MU/Vial = 66.8 mg CBA/Vial\r\r\n(Dose calculated by CBA)\r\r\n1.Preterm and term neonates: \r\r\n(1) General dosing: IM, IV: 2.5-5 mg CBA/kg/day divided every 6-12 hours. (multidrug-resistant gram-negative bacilli:Loading: 2.5 - 5 mg CBA/kg/dose STAT, then2.5 - 5 mg CBA/kg/day Q6-12h)\r\r\n(2) Pulmonary infection:　Inhalation: 4 mg CBA/kg/dose Q12H. \r\r\n2.Infants to Adolescents:\r\r\n(1) General dosing: IM, IV: 2.5-5 mg CBA/kg/day divided every 6-12 hours. (commonly every 8 hours)\r\r\n(2) Systemic infections due to multidrug- resistant gram-negative bacilli: IM, IV: 2.5-5 mg CBA/kg once (max: 300mg CBA/dose), followed by 5 mg CBA/kg/day divided every 8-12 hours (max: 180 mg/dose).\r\r\n(3) Pulmonary infection due to multidrug-resistant gram-negative bacilli : Inhalation: Infants: 4 mg CBA/kg/dose Q12H, max 75 mg CBA/dose; Children and Adolescents: 75-150 mg CBA Q12H.\r\r\n(4) Cystic fibrosis, Pulmonary infection: \r\r\nIV: Age ≧5 y/o: usual 3-5 mg CBA/kg/day divided every 8 hours; max dose: 100 mg CBA/dose.\r\r\nInhalation: Children and Adolescents: usual 75-150 mg CBA Q12H.",
