      "成人常用劑量說明": "IV infusion (dose calculate by actual body weight).\r\r\n1.In combination with lenalidomide and low-dose dexamethason (DRd regimen):\r\r\n\tWeeks 1-8: IV 16 mg/kg QW for 8 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 9-24: IV 16 mg/kg once Q2W for 8 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 25 and beyond: IV 16 mg/kg Q4W until disease progression.\r\r\n2.In combination with pomalidomide and low-dose dexamethasone (DPd regimen): \r\r\n\tWeeks 1-8: IV 16 mg/kg QW for 8 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 9-24: IV 16 mg/kg Q2W for 8 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 25 and beyond: IV 16 mg/kg Q4W until disease progression.\r\r\n3.In combination with bortezomib, melphalan, and prednisone (D-VMP regimen):\r\r\n\tWeeks 1-6: IV 16 mg/kg QW for 6 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 7-54: IV 16 mg/kg Q3W for 16 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 55 and beyond: IV 16 mg/kg Q4W until disease progression. \r\r\n4.In combination with thalidomide, bortezomib, and dexamethasone (DVTd regimen):\r\r\n(1)Induction:\r\r\n\tWeeks 1-8: IV 16 mg/kg QW for 8 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 9-16: IV 16 mg/kg Q2W for 4 doses.\r\r\n(2)Consolidation (following high dose chemotherapy and autologous stem cell     transplant (ASCT)):\r\r\n\tWeeks 1-8: IV 16 mg/kg Q2W for 4 doses.\r\r\n5.In combination with bortezomib and dexamethasone (D-Vd regimen):\r\r\n\tWeeks 1-9: IV 16 mg/kg QW for 9 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 10-24: IV 16 mg/kg Q3W for 5 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 25 and beyond: IV 16 mg/kg Q4W until disease progression.\r\r\n6.In combination with carfilzomib and dexamethasone (DKd regimen):\r\r\n\tWeek 1: IV 8 mg/kg on days 1 and 2.\r\r\n\tWeeks 2-8: IV 16 mg/kg QW for 7 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 9-24: IV 16 mg/kg Q2W for 8 doses.\r\r\n\tWeeks 25 and beyond: IV 16 mg/kg Q4W until disease progression.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "Safety and effectiveness in pediatric patients have not been established.",
      "貯藏方式": "2-8°C, Do not freeze or shake. Protect from light.\r\r\n開封後儲存條件：稀釋後室溫(20-25°C)及室內光線下15小時;冷藏狀態下(2-8°C)24小時。",
      "用藥方法": "1.依據病患的體重計算所需要的劑量 2.抽取所需要的DARZALEX溶液量，將其加入裝有0.9%氯化鈉的輸注袋/ 輸注容器中，稀釋至適當的體積 3.輕輕翻轉輸注袋/ 輸注容器，使溶液混和均勻。切勿振搖。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.僅供單次使用 2.輸注袋/ 輸注容器的材質必須為聚氯乙烯(PVC)、聚丙烯(PP)、聚乙烯(PE)或聚烯烴(PO) 3.應使用裝有流量調節器及管線內置式、無菌、無熱源、低蛋白結合性、聚醚（PES）製之過濾器（孔徑0.22 或0.2 微米）的輸注套組靜脈輸注稀釋後的溶液。4.切勿與其他藥物透過同一靜脈輸注管線同時輸注。5.提醒病人，如果出現下列任何輸注反應的徵兆或症狀，應立即就醫診治：搔癢、流鼻水或鼻塞；寒顫、噁心、喉嚨痛、咳嗽、頭痛、呼吸短促或呼吸困難。6.如果出現發燒、不明瘀傷或出血的現象，應與醫護人員聯絡。7.準備輸血時，應告知健康照護人員(包括輸血中心/ 人員)，有在使用本藥。",
