      "成人常用劑量說明": "IV infusion (>60min)\r\r\n1.NSCLC: \r\r\n(1)BW ≧30kg: monotherapy 10mg/kg every 2 weeks, or 1500mg every 4 weeks.\r\r\n(2)BW <30kg: 10mg/kg every 2 weeks.\r\r\n2.ES-SCLC: \r\r\n(1)BW ≧30kg: 1500mg every 3 weeks for 4 cycles in combination with chemotherapy, followed by 1500mg every 4 weeks as a single agent; \r\r\n(2)BW <30kg: 20mg/kg every 3 weeks for 4 cycles in combination with chemotherapy, followed by 20 mg/kg every 4 weeks as a single agent.\r\r\n3.Biliary tract cancer (BTC):\r\r\n(1)BW ≧30kg: 1500mg every 3 weeks for up to 8 cycles in combination with chemotherapy, followed by 1500mg every 4 weeks as a single agent.\r\r\n(2)BW <30kg: 20mg/kg every 3 weeks for up to 8 cycles in combination with chemotherapy, followed by 20mg/kg every 4 weeks as a single agent.\r\r\n4.Hepatocellular carcinoma, unresectable (uHCC): \r\r\n(1)BW ≧30kg: 1500mg on day 1 of cycle 1 (in combination with tremelimumab), followed by 1500mg every 4 weeks as a single agent.\r\r\n(2)BW <30kg: 20mg/kg on day 1 of cycle 1 (in combination with tremelimumab), followed by  20mg/kg every 4 weeks as a single agent.\r\r\n5.Endometrial cancer, Primary advanced or recurrent dMMR disease, in combination with CARBOplatin and paclitaxel, followed by durvalumab monotherapy: (1)BW ≧30kg: 1120mg in combination with carboplatin and paclitaxelevery 3 weeks for 6 cycles, followed by durvalumab 1500mg single-agent every 4 weeks. (2)BW <30kg: 15 mg/kg  in combination with carboplatin and paclitaxelevery 3 weeks for 6 cycles, followed by durvalumab 20 mg/kg single-agent every 4 weeks.\r\r\n6.Bladder cancer:\r\r\n(1)BW ≧30kg: 1500mg every 3 weeks (in combination with gemcitabine and cisplatin) for 4 neoadjuvant cycles, followed by radical cystectomy, and then 1500mg every 4 weeks for upto 8 cycles after surgery.\r\r\n(2)BW <30kg: 20 mg/kg every 3 weeks (in combination with gemcitabine and cisplatin) for 4 neoadjuvant cycles, followed by radical cystectomy, and then 20 mg/kg every 4 weeks for upto 8 cycles after surgery.\r\r\n7.Gastric or gastroesophageal junction adenocarcinoma:\r\r\n(1)BW ≧30kg: 1500mg every 4 weeks (in combination with FLOT regimen) for 4 cycles(2 neoadjuvant cylces and 2 adjuvant cycles), followed by 1,500 mg every 4 weeks (single-agent) for upto 10 adjuvant cycles; .\r\r\n(2)BW <30kg: 20 mg/kg every 4 weeks (in combination with FLOT regimen) for 4 cycles(2 neoadjuvant cylces and 2 adjuvant cycles), followed by 20 mg/kg every 4 weeks (single-agent) for upto 10 adjuvant cycles.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "The safety and effectiveness of durvalumab have not been established in pediatric patients.",
      "貯藏方式": "2-8℃原盒避光儲存，避免搖晃、不要凍結。\r\r\n開封後儲存條件：從配製起算，在2-8℃不應超過24小時，若在室溫下(最高25℃)不應超過8小時。",
      "用藥方法": "稀釋後靜脈輸注60分鐘",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.稀釋溶液的最終濃度應在1-15mg/ml之間。2.不要通過同一條輸注管線同時給予其他藥物。",
