      "id": "drug-135",
      "藥品學名": "Eculizumab 300mg/Vial",
      "中文名稱": "舒立瑞 濃縮靜脈輸注液",
      "商品名稱": "Soliris 300mg/Vial",
      "成分及含量": "Eculizumab 300 mg/30 mL/Vial 舒立瑞濃縮靜脈輸注液",
      "藥品手冊適應症": "1.Paroxysmal nocturnal hemoglobinuria. \r\r\n2.Atypical hemolytic uremic syndrome \r\r\n3.Neuromyelitis optica spectrum disorder(NMOSD) in adult patients who are Anti-aquaporin-4 (AQP4) antibody positive.",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "IV. (35~120 mins) Hemolytic uremic syndrome: 900 mg every 7 days for the first 4 weeks, then 1200 mg for the fifth dose 7 days later, then 1200 mg every 14 days thereafter.\r\r\nParoxysmal nocturnal hemoglobinuria: 600 mg every 7 days for the first 4 weeks, then 900 mg for the fifth dose 7 days later, then 900 mg every 14 days thereafter.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "IV.(1~4 hrs) Hemolytic uremic syndrome: ≧40 kg: 900 mg every 7 days for the first 4 weeks, then 1200 mg for the fifth dose 7 days later, then 1200 mg every 14 days thereafter.\r\r\n30-40 kg: 600 mg every 7 days for the first 2 weeks, then 900 mg for the third dose 7 days later, then 900 mg every 14 days thereafter.\r\r\n20-30 kg: 600 mg every 7 days for the first 3 weeks, then 600 mg every 14 days thereafter.\r\r\n10-20 kg: 600 mg every 7 days for the first dose, then 300 mg for the second dose 7 days later, then 300 mg every 14 days thereafter.\r\r\n5-10 kg: 300 mg every 7 days for the first 2 weeks, then 300 mg every 21 days thereafter.\r\r\nParoxysmal nocturnal hemoglobinuria: safety and efficacy not established for patients under 18 years.",
      "貯藏方式": "開封後儲存條件：配製或稀釋後，在18~25度環境下，24小時內用畢。\r\r\n須冷藏於2-8度，不可冷凍。",
      "用藥方法": "1.給藥兩週前：必須施打腦膜炎疫苗並提出完打證明。2.請勿使用IV Push或IV Bolus方式給藥。3.可用輸液：0.9% NaCl、0.45% NaCl、D5W、Ringer's，將藥品稀釋到5mg/mL再輸注。4.稀釋後的藥品溶液使用前須回溫至18~25度。5.成人IV輸注時間最短不得少於35分鐘，最長不得多於2小時；兒科病人輸注時間為1-4小時。輸注完畢須再留院觀察1小時。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.給藥兩週前：必須施打腦膜炎疫苗並提出完打證明。",
