      "成人常用劑量說明": "(健保限終生申請39次輸注)\r\r\nSC. Administer 12 mg on day 1, then 32 mg on day 4, followed by 76 mg QW (start from day 8 and continued to week 24), then 76 mg QOW (start from week 25).",
