      "藥品手冊適應症": "1.Disorder of cardiovascular system, Secondary prophylaxis.\r\r\n2.Familial hypercholesterolemia - homozygous, In combination with other lipid-lowering therapies.\r\r\n3.Primary heterozygous familial hypercholesterolemia, Alone or in combination with other lipid-lowering therapies.\r\r\n4.Primary hypercholesterolemia, Alone or in combination with other lipid-lowering therapies.",
