      "中文名稱": "西美芬凍晶靜脈注射劑",
      "商品名稱": "Cymevene 500mg/Vial",
      "成分及含量": "Ganciclovir sodium 500 mg/Vial 西美芬凍晶靜脈注射劑\r\r\n(each vial contains Na 46 mg, pH 11)",
      "藥品手冊適應症": "1. Cytomegaloviral retinitis\r\r\n2. Cytomegalovirus infection, Transplantation; Prophylaxis\r\r\n3. Cytomegalovirus infection; Prophylaxis - HIV infection, Advanced",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "IVD(>1 hr). CMV retinitis - Induction: 5 mg/kg q12h for 14-21days, maintenance: 5 mg/kg daily.\r\r\nPrevention of CMV disease in transplant recipients - 5 mg/kg q12h for 7-14 days, followed by 5 mg/kg qd × 7 days or 6 mg/kg qd × 5 days per week.\r\r\nDosage adjustment：ANC < 500 cells/microliter - not use.\r\r\n\t\tPlatelets < 25,000 cells/microliter - not use.\r\r\n\t\tneutropenia, anemia and/or thrombocytopenia occur - reduce dose",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "IVD(>1 hr).\r\r\nNeonatal,Infant:\r\r\n1.Congenital cytomegalovirus (CMV) infection, symptomatic; treatment:6 mg/kg Q12h, transition to oral valganciclovir (when able) to complete total treatment duration of 6 months.\r\r\nPediatric(Infants–Adolescents):\r\r\n1.CMV disease, treatment, Non-HIV:\r\r\n(1)Induction: 5 mg/kg Q12H for ≧2–3 weeks until viremia and symptoms resolve; if inadequate response: may up to 7.5 mg/kg Q12H. (>9y: CMV retinitis may combine 2 mg Intravitreal injection).\r\r\n(2)Maintenance: 5 mg/kg QD, 5–7 days/week; duration depends on immunosuppression.\r\r\n(Not routinely recommended in solid organ transplant).\r\r\n2.CMV disease, preemptive:\r\r\n(1)Hematopoietic cell transplant:<100 days: 5 mg/kg Q12H × 7–14 days, then 5 mg/kg QD until negative;>100 days: 5 mg/kg Q12H × 7–14 days, then 5 mg/kg QD × 1-2 weeks or until negative.\r\r\n(2)Solid organ transplant: 5 mg/kg Q12H; some taper to QD after 2 weeks(Ref.Redbook)\r\r\n3.Cytomegalovirus infection, CNS (HIV-exposed/-infected):\r\r\n(1)Infants–Children:Induction: 5 mg/kg Q12H + foscarnet until symptoms improve; Maintenance: 5 mg/kg QD; continue until on ART ≧6 months and CD4 sustained ≧6 months (age <6 y: CD4 ≧15%; age ≧6 y: >100 cells/mm?)\r\r\n(2)Adolescents:5 mg/kg Q12H + foscarnet until symptoms improve; duration not defined.",
      "貯藏方式": "開封後儲存條件：配製後：室溫12小時，不可冷藏；稀釋後：冷藏(2-8℃)24小時；配製時建議戴手套、口罩、護目鏡。",
      "用藥方法": "1.以10 mL滅菌注射用水(不含parabens)配製成濃度50 mg/mL。對人類具致癌性和致畸胎性且為強鹼，配製時建議戴手套、口罩、護目鏡。2.再以生理食鹽水、5%右旋葡萄糖水溶液、林格氏液或乳酸林格氏液稀釋，最終輸注濃度必須≦10mg/ml。不可和其他的靜脈注射產品混合。3.不可快速或推注注射入靜脈！濃度過高可能會使毒性增加。PH值約11，肌肉或皮下注射可能導致嚴重的組織刺激。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.如有發生抽蓄、鎮靜、頭暈、運動失調或神智混亂時應避免開車或操作器械。\r\r\n2.除非必要，否則不建議與imipenem-cilastatin併用，曾有發生抽搐的報告。\r\r\n3.育齡婦女治療期間應採用有效避孕措施。男性病患治療期間及之後至少90天應施行阻絕式的避孕。",
      "健保價格": "1492",
      "自費價": "1886"
