      "成人常用劑量說明": "IVD(30 mins; <1 hr). \r\r\n1.Non-small cell lung cancer：4 week schedule : 1000 mg/m2 over 30 minutes on \r\r\ndays 1, 8, and 15 of each 28-day cycle. 3 week schedule : 1250 mg/m2 over 30 minutes on days 1 and 8 of each 21-day cycle.\r\r\n2.Pancreatic cancer：Week 1-8, 1000 mg/m2 over 30 minutes QW for 7 weeks, followed by 1 week of rest from treatment. After week 8, 1000 mg/m(2) IV weekly on days 1, 8, and 15 of 28-day cycles\r\r\n3.Urothelial carcinoma: 1,000 mg/m2 over 30 minutes on days 1, 8, and 15 of a 28-day treatment cycle (in combination with cisplatin) for up to 6 cycles.\r\r\n4.Metastatic Breast cancer: 1250 mg/m(2) IV over 30 minutes on days 1, 8 of a 3-week cycle (in combination with paclitaxel). \r\r\n5.Ovarian cancer, Advanced, In combination with carboplatin for patients who relapsed at least 6 months after platinum-based therapy: 1,000 mg/m2 over 30 minutes on days 1, 8 of a 3-week cycle (in combination with carboplatin).\r\r\n6.Biliary tract cancer: Single agent therapy: 1000 mg/m2 over 30 minutes on days 1, 8, and 15 of 28-day cycles. In combination with cisplatin: Gemcitabine 1000 mg/m2 over 30 minutes on days 1, 8 of 21-day cycles.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "Limited data available\r\r\n1.Hodgkin lymphoma, refractory or relapsed:  \r\r\n(1) Children and Adolescents: IV. 1,000 mg/m2/dose over 100 minutes on days 1 and 8 (in combination with brentuximab); repeat cycle every 21 days.\r\r\n(2) Children ≧10 years and Adolescents: IV. 1,000 mg/m2/dose over 100 minutes on days 1 and 8 (in combination with vinorelbine); repeat cycle every 21 days.\r\r\n2.Sarcomas, refractory or relapsed: Children ≧3 years and Adolescents: (1)IV. 675 or 1,000 mg/m2/dose over 90 minutes on days 1 and 8 (in combination with docetaxel); repeat cycle every 21 days. or (2)IV. 1,000 mg/m2/dose over 30 minutes on days 1 and 8 (in combination with oxaliplatin and irinotecan); repeat cycle every 28 days.\r\r\n3.Solid tumors, refractory or relapsed: Children ≧1 year and Adolescents: (1)IV. 1,000 mg/m2/dose over 30 minutes on days 1 and 8 (in combination with oxaliplatin and irinotecan); repeat cycle every 28. or (2)IV. 1,000 mg/m2/dose over 100 minutes on day 1 (in combination with oxaliplatin); repeat cycle every 14 days.\r\r\n*Dosage reductions for toxicity: 800 mg/m2/dose over 80 minutes if grade 3/4 nonhematological toxicity, grade 4 neutropenia with documented infection or lasting >7 days, grade 3/4 thrombocytopenia lasting >7 days or requiring platelets during >7 days, or delay of next cycle ≧14 days; if necessary, dose could be reduced a second time to 600 mg/m2/dose.\r\r\n4.Germ cell tumor, refractory: Adolescents ≧16 years: IV. 1,200 mg/m2/dose over 30 minutes on days 1, 8, and 15; repeat cycle every 28 days for up to 6 cycles. (uptodate)",
      "貯藏方式": "儲存於攝氏2℃~8℃，不可冷凍。配置後之溶液在控制室溫下（攝氏20-25 度）可維持穩定24 小時。",
      "用藥方法": "1.靜脈點滴輸注。給藥時將注射液用NS稀釋，最低濃度可低至 0.1mg/mL。2.本藥輸注時間為30分鐘；輸注時間勿超過60分鐘，延長輸注時間會增加毒性。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.致吐性：中低度致吐 (有10-30%的病人會發生嘔吐)。2.因免疫力降低，可能增加感染的危險：通常白血球會在給藥後降低，如果有任何感染的症狀如發燒，打顫，喉嚨痛等，請盡速就醫。3.也會造成血小板減少及貧血的現象，要注意身上是否有小紫斑，或小出血點。可能會較容易感到疲勞。4.可能會有末梢水腫(20%)、掉髮(15-18%)、皮疹(10-30%)、搔癢(13%)。5.肝功能指數升高(12%)。停藥可恢復。6.肌肉痛(33%)、關節痛(24%)、骨頭痛(11%)。使用止痛藥可緩解。6.感覺神經病變(23-64%)、末梢運動神經病變(15-35%)、頭痛(14%)、嗜睡(3-11%)、感覺異常(10%)。停藥後大多可緩解。7.在接受Gemcitabine治療期間和治療結束後至少6個月，有生育能力的女性應該使用有效的避孕方法。8.建議正在接受Gemcitabine治療的男性在治療期間以及治療結束後至少3個月避免生育，並在治療前尋求有關冷凍保存精子的進一步建議，因Gemcitabine治療可能導致不孕。9.哺乳:在接受Gemcitabine治療期間至最後一劑1週，應停止哺乳。",
      "健保價格": "360",
      "自費價": "466"
