      "藥品手冊適應症": "1.Leucovorin rescue, Of inadvertent overdoses of folic acid antagonists with less affinity for mammalian dihydrofolate reductase than methotrexate.\r\r\n\r\r\n2.Leucovorin rescue, To diminish the toxicity and counteract the effects of impaired methotrexate elimination and of inadvertent overdose.",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "(1) Advanced colorectal cancer: 200mg/m2 by slow IV >3 mins, followed by 5-FU 370mg/m2; OR 20mg/m2, followed by 5-FU 425 mg/m2. Treatment is repeated daily for 5 days; may repeat in 4 week intervals for 2 courses then 4-5 week intervals based on patient tolerance.\r\r\n(2) Rescue therapy of high dose MTX: 15mg (10mg/m(2)) IM/IV q6h for 10 doses, starts 24 hrs after the beginning of the MTX infusion; continue until serum MTX level< 5x10(-8)M. If significant clinical toxicity is observed, may use extended dossage for an additional 24 hours (total 14 doses over 84 hours).\r\r\n(3) Leucovorin rescue, To diminish the toxicity and counteract the effects of impaired methotrexate elimination and of inadvertent overdose: 15mg (10mg/m(2))IM/IV q6h initiated within 24 hours of MTX, until serum MTX level< 10(-8)M; if 24 hour serum creatinine 50% above baseline, or 24-hour MTX level >5 x 10(-6)M, OR 48-hour MTX level >9 x 10(-7)M, increase dose to 150mg (100mg/m(2)) IV every 3 hour until serum MTX <10(-8)M.\r\r\n(4) Megaloblastic anemia due to folate deficiency: up to 1mg IV daily.",
