      "兒童常用劑量說明": "IVD.\r\r\n1.Neonatal, General dosing:\r\r\n(1)PMA <34 weeks: loading dose 15 mg/kg; Maintenance dose 7.5 mg/kg Q12H.\r\r\n(2)PMA 34-40 weeks: loading dose 15 mg/kg; Maintenance dose 7.5 mg/kg Q8H.\r\r\n(3)PMA >40 weeks: loading dose 15 mg/kg; Maintenance dose 7.5 mg/kg Q6H or 10 mg/kg Q8H.\r\r\n2.Neonatal, Surgical prophylaxis, administer 30-60 minutes prior to surgical incision: \r\r\n(1)BW < 1.2 kg: 7.5 mg/kg as a single dose.\r\r\n(2)BW ≧ 1.2 kg: 15 mg/kg as a single dose.\r\r\n3.Infants to Adolescents, General dosing: 22.5-40 mg/kg/day in divided doses every 6-8 hours; Max: 4,000 mg/day.\r\r\n4.Clostridioides difficile infection: \r\r\n(1)Infants, mild to moderate infection: 7.5 mg/kg Q6H for 10 days.\r\r\n(2)Children and Adolescents, severe/fulminant infection:  initial IV 10 mg/kg Q8H for 10 days; maximum dose: 500 mg/dose; use concomitantly with oral or rectal vancomycin.\r\r\n5.Intra-abdominal infection: Infants to Adolescents: 30-40 mg/kg/day in divided doses every 8 hours as part of combination therapy;  max: 500 mg/dose.\r\r\n6.Surgical prophylaxis, Children and Adolescents: 15 mg/kg as a single dose 30-60 minutes prior to procedure; maximum dose: 500 mg/dose.\r\r\n7.Brain abscess: Infants to Adolescents: Loading: 15 mg/kg; Maintenance: 7.5 mg/kg Q6H (Max: 500 mg/dose).",
      "貯藏方式": "15-30℃, protect from light. (可置日光燈下)\r\r\n開封後儲存條件：避光(可置日光燈下)，室溫或冷藏24小時。",
