      "成分及含量": "Obinutuzumab 1000 mg/40 mL/Vial 癌即瓦",
      "藥品手冊適應症": "Chronic lymphoid leukemia, Follicular lymphoma, glofitamab pretreatment, Lupus nephritis.",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "IV infusion.\r\r\n1.Chronic lymphoid leukemia: Dosage, 28-day cycles: Cycle 1, day 1, 100 mg IV at 25 mg/hr over 4 hours ; cycle 1, day 2, 900 mg IV at 50 mg/hr (may increase by 50 mg/hr every 30 minutes to MAX 400 mg/hr); cycle 1, day 8 and day 15, 1000 mg IV at a starting rate of 100 mg/hr (may increase by 100 mg/hr increments every 30 minutes to MAX 400 mg/hr); cycles 2 through 6, day 1, 1000 mg IV at a starting rate of 100 mg/hr (may increase by 100 mg/hr increments every 30 minutes to MAX 400 mg/hr) \r\r\n\r\r\n2.Follicular lymphoma: \r\r\nCycle 1 (loading doses) day 1, 1000 mg IV at 50 mg/hr; rate may be increased in 50 mg/hr increments every 30 minutes to MAX 400 mg/hr; cycle 1, day 8 and day 15, 1000 mg IV at 100 mg/hr (if there was no infusion reaction during previous infusions and the final rate >=100 mg/hr), rate may be increased by 100 mg/hr increments every 30 minutes to MAX 400 mg/hr; \r\r\nCycles 2-6 (or cycle 2-8  if with CHOP or CVP therapy) , day 1, 1000 mg IV at 100 mg/hr, rate may be increased by 100 mg/hr increments every 30 minutes to MAX 400 mg/hr. \r\r\nFollowing  maintenance treatment:  give obinutuzumab monotherapy every 2 months up to 2 years: 1000 mg at 100 mg/hr, rate may be increased by 100 mg/hr increments every 30 minutes to MAX 400 mg/hr.\r\r\n\r\r\n3.Diffuse large B cell lymphoma, relapsed or refractory; glofitamab pretreatment: IV 1,000 mg as a single dose 7 days prior to initiation of glofitamab, starting at 50 mg/hr and may increasing by 50 mg/hr every 30 minutes to a maximum of 400 mg/hr.\r\r\n\r\r\n4.Lupus nephritis: IV 1,000 mg at weeks 0, 2, 24, and 26, followed by IV 1,000 mg every 6 months starting 6 months after dose 4. Dose 1 infusion starts at 50 mg/hr and may be increased by 50 mg/hr every 30 minutes to a maximum of 400 mg/hr; dose 2 and subsequent doses start at 100 mg/hr and may be increased by 100 mg/hr every 30 minutes to a maximum of 400 mg/hr.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "Safety and effectiveness not established in pediatric patients",
      "貯藏方式": "未開封:2-8℃，避光。\r\r\n開封後儲存條件：稀釋後2-8°C最長24小時。回室溫後可再存放48小時(包括輸注時間)。",
      "用藥方法": "注入含有0.9%NS的PVC或non-PVC polyolefin之輸注袋內依所需劑量稀釋至最終濃度介於0.4-4 mg/mL之間給藥。輕輕反轉以混合稀釋溶液。不可搖晃或冷凍。僅能經由靜脈輸注給藥。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.每次輸注前給予前置藥物(pre-medication)。2.僅可經由專用注射管線以靜脈輸注方式給藥。3.不可以靜脈推注(push)或灌注(bolus)方式給藥。4.定期監測血球計數、應於有適當醫療支援能夠處理可能致命的重度輸注反應之環境中，由醫療專業人員進行GAZYVA投予。5.對於有腫瘤溶解症候群(tumor lysis syndrome，TLS)高風險的患者，應給予預防性之水份補充並給予抗高尿酸血症藥物。6.建議具有生殖潛力的女性應在接受本藥治療期間以及最後一次給藥後的 18 個月內採取有效的避孕措施。7.哺乳: 在接受本藥治療期間以及最後一次給藥後的 18 個月內避免補乳。",
      "健保價格": "88718",
      "自費價": "111758"
