      "兒童常用劑量說明": "IM only.\r\r\n1.Syphilis, congenital: Preterm and term neonates: 50,000 units/kg as a single dose.\r\r\n2.Syphilis: Infants to Adolescents:\r\r\n(1)Primary, Secondary, Early Latent (<1 year duration): 50,000 units/kg as a single injection, Max: 2.4 million units/dose\r\r\n(2)Re-treatment of primary, secondary, or early latent disease after failure of previous therapy: 50,000 units/kg/dose QW for 3 doses,Max: 2.4 million units/dose\r\r\n(3)Late Latent or unknown duration: 50,000 units/kg/dose QW for 3 doses,Max: 2.4 million units/dose\r\r\n2.Streptococcus, group A:\r\r\n(1)Pharyngitis/tonsillitis(Infants to Adolescents): BW ≦27 kg: 600,000 units as a single dose; BW>27 kg: 1.2 million units as a single dose.\r\r\n(2)Secondary prevention of rheumatic fever: children and Adolescents: BW ≦27 kg: 600,000 units every 3-4 weeks; BW>27 kg: 1.2 million units every 3-4 weeks.(uptodate)\r\r\n3.Prophylactic treatment of acute articular rheumatism, post-streptococcal glomerulonephritis and erysipelas: children BW <30 kg: 600,000 units every 3-4 weeks; BW >30 kg: 1.2 million units every 3-4 weeks.(仿單)",
      "貯藏方式": "未開封：室溫。開封後儲存條件：配製後：後應立即使用。",
      "用藥方法": "1.配製: 將water for injection 5mL加入小瓶中。\r\r\n2.只能用於肌肉注射。建議緩慢、深層肌肉注射。\r\r\n3.注射於臀部外上側。小於2歲的兒童，應肌肉注射到側面中央的大腿肌肉，而不是臀部。不要注入靠近動脈或神經;重複劑量時，應轉換注射部位。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.對盤尼西林類抗生素過敏的患者，不可使用。2.腹瀉是一種由抗生素引起的常見問題，停用之後通常就會隨之消退。有時甚至在使用最後一劑抗生素的2個月之後或更久還會發生腹瀉及糞便帶血的症狀（有/無胃痙攣及發燒）。如果發生這些症狀，應盡快聯絡醫師。3.本品含有大豆磷脂，可能引起有大豆過敏史的患者出現超敏反應。",
      "健保價格": "949",
      "自費價": "1323"
