      "藥品手冊適應症": "1.Primary humoral immunodeficiency.\r\r\n2.Chronic immune thrombocytopenic purpura (ITP) in patients age 15 years\r\r\nand older.\r\r\n3.Guillain-Barre Syndrome\r\r\n4.Kawasaki Disease\r\r\n5.Chronic inflammatory demyelinating polyneuropathy (CIDP) in adults.\r\r\n6.Multifocal Motor Neuropathy (MMN)\r\r\n7.Myasthenia Gravis exacerbations (MG)\r\r\n8.Lambert-Eaton Myasthenic Syndrome \r\r\n9.Stiff Person Syndrome",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "1.PID: Initial 0.4-0.8g/kg, then 0.2-0.8g/kg every 3-4 weeks. \r\r\n2.Congenital AIDS with recurrent bacterial infections: 0.2-0.4g/kg every 3-4 weeks.\r\r\n3.Hypogammaglobulinaemia in patients after allogeneic haematopoietic stem cell transplantation: 0.2-0.4 g/kg every 3-4 weeks. The trough levels should be maintained above 5 g/L.\r\r\n4.ITP: Initial 0.8-1 g/kg/dose, may repeat 1 dose within 3 days or 0.4g/kg daily for 2-5 days. The treatment can be repeated if relapse occurs. \r\r\n5.Guillain-Barr? Syndrome: 0.4g/kg/day for 5 days.\r\r\n6.Kawasaki Disease: 2g/kg as a single dose over 10-12 hours(uptodate). Patients should receive concomitant treatment with acetylsalicylic acid.\r\r\n7.CIDP: Initial 2g/kg given in divided doses over 2-5 consecutive days. Maintenance, 1 g/kg IV given over 1 day or as 2 divided doses on 2 consecutive days, every 3 weeks. \r\r\n(initial rate 0.5 mg/kg/min, may gradually increase to a MAX of 8 mg/kg/min).\r\r\n8.MMN: Initial 2g/kg given in divided doses over 2-5 consecutive days. Maintenance 0.4-2g/kg every 2-6 weeks.\r\r\n9.MG, prior to surgery or during myasthenic crisis: Initial 1-2g/kg given in divided doses over 2-5 consecutive days. Maintenance, 0.4-1g/kg every 4-6 weeks.\r\r\n10.Lambert-Eaton Myasthenic Syndrome: Initial 2g/kg given in divided doses over 2-5 consecutive days. Maintenance, 0.4-1g/kg every 2-6 weeks.\r\r\n11.Stiff Person Syndrome: Initial 2g/kg given in divided doses over 2-5 consecutive days. Maintenance, 1-2g/kg every 4-6 weeks.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "Kawasaki Disease: Acute phase: Initial, 2 g/kg IV infusion over 10 to 12 hours within 10 days of illness onset A second dose of 2 g/kg can be administered in cases of persistent or recrudescent fever at least 36 hours after the end of the first infusion.(micromedex)",
      "貯藏方式": "≦25℃，請勿冷凍。",
      "用藥方法": "1.靜脈輸注用。\r\r\n2.必須在使用期間進行排氣。請勿在同一條輸注管線中混合其他藥品。\r\r\n3.勿與生理食鹽水混合。但輸注管路可用生理食鹽水灌注或沖洗。若有需要，可使用5%葡萄糖溶液等量稀釋。\r\r\n4.緩慢的初始輸注速率(0.3 mL/kg/hr)較不會對人體免疫球蛋白產生敏感。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.使用本藥可能發生血栓，尤其高齡、長時間不活動、具靜脈或動脈血栓病史、使用雌激素、裝有留置型的中央靜脈導管、患血液高度黏稠之疾病及具心血管危險因子。無已知血栓危險因子者亦可能發生血栓。注射中或後若出現任何血栓相關徵兆(手臂或腿變色、疼痛、腫脹發熱；不明原因胸悶、呼吸急促、脈搏加快；身體單側麻木或虛弱感)，應立即告知醫療人員。\r\r\n2.接受免疫球蛋白後六週到三個月內，施打活性減毒病毒疫苗(例如麻疹、腮腺炎、德國麻疹和水痘疫苗)的效果會變差，應間隔三個月再接種活性減毒病毒疫苗。對於麻疹，其效力降低可能會持續一年，建議應檢查麻疹抗體狀態。\r\r\n3.常見副作用：冷顫、頭痛、暈眩、發燒、嘔吐、過敏反應、噁心、關節疼痛、低血壓、中等程度的下背痛偶爾會發生。\r\r\n4.本產品由人類血漿製得，已嚴格去除各種已知感染原，但仍有未知感染原之風險。使用後如有感染現象應立即向診療醫師反應。",
