      "成人常用劑量說明": "IM. IV. IVD. 0.3-1.1 mg/kg, recovery takes place within 4-6 minutes.\r\r\nDosage adjustment：Decrease plasma pseudocholinesterase conc. - a test dose of 5-10 mg to evaluate sensitivity, or cautiously administer 1mg/ml to produce NMB.\r\r\n(ex: lung cancer, severe dehydration, thyroid disease, severe anemia, acute infection, collagen disease, or malnutrition)\r\r\n\t\tMyasthenia gravis - resistant to 0.5 mg/kg, but not 1 mg/kg.",
