      "藥品手冊適應症": "Procedural sedation, Induction and maintenance",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "IV.\r\r\nIndividualize dosing and titrate to desired clinical response.\r\r\n1.Induction: 5 mg IV over 1 minute. Induction in ASA-PS (American Society of Anesthesiologists Physical Status) III and IV patients: 2.5-5 mg IV over 1 minute based upon the general condition of the patient.\r\r\n2.Maintenance: 2.5 mg IV over 15 seconds as needed; at least 2 minutes must elapse prior to administration of any supplemental dose. Maintenance in ASA-PS III and IV patients: 1.25-2.5 mg IV over 15 seconds as needed; at least 2 minutes must elapse prior to administration of any supplemental dose.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "Safety and effectiveness not established in pediatric patients.",
      "貯藏方式": "開封後儲存條件：調配後：室溫(25℃) 下可保存24小時。\r\r\n未開封：室溫(25℃)",
      "用藥方法": "以靜脈注射給藥。使用前以8.2 mL 的0.9%氯化鈉注射液沿瓶壁注入小瓶中，輕輕旋轉(不要劇烈搖晃)小瓶直到內容物完全溶解。調配完成的產品溶液最終濃度為2.5 mg/mL。",
