      "藥品手冊適應症": "Adjunct to general anesthesia for endotracheal intubation, relax skeletal muscle during surgery or mechanical ventilation.",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "IV only. Surgical Procedures:\r\r\n1.Tracheal intubation: 0.6 mg/kg;  1.0 mg/kg if rapid induction is needed.\r\r\n2.Maintenance: 0.075-0.15 mg/kg.\r\r\n3.Continuous infusion: 0.6 mg/kg, infusion rate 0.3-0.6\r\r\nmg/kg/hr (with inhaled anesthetic: infusion rate 0.3-0.4 mg/kg/hr)\r\r\n*Other suggestion from uptodate:\r\r\n1.Rapid sequence intubation, neuromuscular blockade: IV. 1-1.2 mg/kg once.\r\r\n2.Endotracheal intubation: IV. 0.45-1.2 mg/kg, depending on desired onset and duration.\r\r\n3.Neuromuscular blockade during general anesthesia:\r\r\n(1)Intermittent: IV 0.1-0.2 mg/kg; repeat as needed \r\r\n(2)Continuous infusion: initial IV 5-12 mcg/kg/minute; titrate as needed (usual dose range 5-16 mcg/kg/minute).",
