      "藥品手冊適應症": "Diabetes mellitus",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "SC.\r\r\n1.Type 1 DM, insulin-naive: initial 1/3-1/2 total daily dose (general total daily dose: 0.2- 0.4 units/kg). The remainder of total daily dose given as a short- or rapid-acting insulin divided between each daily meal.\r\r\n2.Type 2 DM, insulin-naive: initial 10 unit QD.\r\r\n3.Type 1 or 2 DM, Conversion from premixed insulin: Initiate at same total daily mixed insulin dose, and administered on the same injection schedule as premixed insulin. \r\r\n4.Type 1 or 2 DM, Conversion from basal insulin: Initiate at same total daily intermediate- or long-acting insulin dose and administered on the same injection schedule as basal insulin. \r\r\n*For patients switching from other insulin regimens who receive short- or rapid-acting insulin at meals, continue the same dose to cover meals not covered by insulin degludec/insulin aspart.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "SC. \r\r\n1.Type 1 or 2 DM, Conversion from premixed insulin: Age ≧1 y/o: Initiate at 80% total daily mixed insulin dose, administered once daily with meals.\r\r\n2.Type 1 or 2 DM, Conversion from basal insulin: Age ≧1 y/o: Initiate at 80% total daily intermediate- or long-acting insulin dose, administered once daily with meals.\r\r\n*For patients switching from other insulin regimens who receive short- or rapid-acting insulin at meals, continue the same dose to cover meals not covered by insulin degludec/insulin aspart.\r\r\n*Not recommended for use in pediatric patients who require <5 units.",
