      "成人常用劑量說明": "SC. \r\r\n1.Plaque psoriasis: SC 300mg at weeks 0, 1, 2, 3, and 4; then maintenance 300mg every 4 weeks. Some patients may only require 150 mg per dose.\r\r\n2.Psoriatic arthritis: SC 150mg at weeks 0, 1, 2, 3, and 4; then maintenance every 4 weeks; dose may increase to 300mg/dose based on clinical effect.\r\r\nFor patients who did not respond well to TNF, 300mg/dose is recommended.\r\r\n3.Ankylosing spondylitis (AS): SC 150mg at weeks 0, 1, 2, 3, and 4; then maintenance every 4 weeks; dose may increase to 300mg/dose based on clinical effect.\r\r\n4.Axial spondyloarthritis (axSpA): SC 150mg at weeks 0, 1, 2, 3, and 4; then maintenance every 4 weeks; dose may increase to 300mg/dose based on clinical effect.\r\r\n5.Non-radiographic axial spondyloarthritis (nr-axSpA): SC 150mg at weeks 0, 1, 2, 3, and 4; then maintenance every 4 weeks.\r\r\n6.Hidradenitis Suppurativa (HS): SC 300mg at week 0,1,2,3, and 4, then maintenance every 2 weeks.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "SC. \r\r\n1.Plaque psoriasis: ≧6y/o, <50kg: 75mg/dose; ≧6y/o, ≧50kg: 150mg/dose (may increase to 300mg). SC at weeks 0, 1, 2, 3, and 4; then maintenance every 4 weeks. \r\r\n2.Juvenile idiopathic arthritis (JIA), including ERA and JPsA: ≧6y/o, <50kg: 75mg/dose; ≧6y/o, ≧50kg: 150mg/dose.(仿單) *Other suggestions from micromedex: ≧4y/o, 15-<50kg: 75mg/dose; ≧4y/o, ≧50kg: 150mg/dose. SC at weeks 0, 1, 2, 3, and 4; then maintenance every 4 weeks. \r\r\n3.Psoriatic arthritis: recommendation from micromedex: ≧2y/o, 15-<50kg: 75mg/dose; ≧2y/o, ≧50kg: 150mg/dose. SC at weeks 0, 1, 2, 3, and 4; then maintenance every 4 weeks.",
      "貯藏方式": "須冷藏於2-8度，不可冷凍。\r\r\n從冰箱取出後要在1小時內注射。",
      "用藥方法": "皮下注射：在大腿前側、下腹部(避開肚臍周圍5 公分的區域)、或上臂外側皮下部位注射。選擇的注射部位，每次都要不同。不要在敏感會痛的、受傷的、發紅的、脫屑的、有硬塊的或有乾癬的皮膚部位注射。避免在有疤痕或妊娠紋的部位注射。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.可能會降低免疫系統對感染的防禦能力而增加感染的風險。2.常見的副作用：感冒症狀、腹瀉、上呼吸道感染。若讓您感到困擾或持續發生，請告知醫師。3.若有活動性結核病感染，不可使用本藥。4.使用本藥時可以併用非活性的疫苗，但不可併用活性疫苗。5. 1mL注射針筒/注射筆和0.5 mL注射針筒的針頭套含有天然乳膠，會引起對乳膠過敏者的過敏反應。",
