      "藥品手冊適應症": "As adjunct to haemostasis during surgical procedures, when control of bleeding by conventional surgical techniques is ineffective or impractical.",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "TISSEEL should only be administered topically. \r\r\nMaximum Surface Area Coverage:\r\r\nSize of Tisseel Package //   With Spray //  With Cannula\r\r\n      2 mL              //   100 cm2    //   8 cm2\r\r\n      4 mL              //   200 cm2    //  16 cm2\r\r\n     10 mL              //   500 cm2    //  40 cm2",
