      "成人常用劑量說明": "IV infusion.\r\r\nMetastatic breast cancer: IV infuse 5.4 mg/kg every 3 weeks. Infuse first infusion over 90 minutes and then subsequent infusions over 30 minutes if prior infusions were well tolerated.",
