      "兒童常用劑量說明": "SC.\r\r\n1.Plaque psoriasis (Moderate to Severe):\r\r\n(1) ≧6 y/o, <60 kg: 0.75 mg/kg SC. at weeks 0 and 4, then every 12 weeks.\r\r\n(2) ≧6 y/o, 60-100 kg: 45 mg SC. at weeks 0 and 4, then every 12 weeks.\r\r\n(3) ≧6 y/o, >100 kg: 90 mg SC at weeks 0 and 4, then every 12 weeks.\r\r\n2.Inflammatory bowel disease, moderate to severe; refractory: Children ≧12 y/o: (uptodate)\r\r\n(1)Induction: (use IV dosage form) IV over at least 1 hour:\r\r\n<55 kg: 260 mg IV over at least 1 hour as a single dose.\r\r\n≧55-85 kg: 390 mg IV over at least 1 hour as a single dose.\r\r\n>85 kg: 520 mg IV over at least 1 hour as a single dose.\r\r\n(2)Maintenance: SC 90 mg every 8 weeks; beginning 8 weeks after induction dose.",
      "貯藏方式": "2-8℃",
      "用藥方法": "單次使用劑型，限皮下注射使用。",
