      "藥品手冊適應症": "Anxiety, convulsive disorders, muscle spasm, insomia",
      "成人常用劑量說明": "Adults: IM or IV(<5 mg/min). \r\r\nAntianxiety: 2-10 mg, repeat in 3-4 hrs if necessary.\r\r\nAcute alcohol withdrawal: initial 10 mg, then 5-10 mg in 3-4 hrs.  \r\r\nStatus epilepticus: 5-10 mg every 5-10 minutes (<5 mg/minute) , Max. 30 mg. \r\r\nMuscle spasm: initial, 5-10 mg, then repeat in 3-4 hrs if needed.\r\r\nNeonates: \r\r\nStatus epilepticus: IV: 0.1-0.3 mg/kg/dose for 3-5 min, q 15-30 min., max. 2 mg/dose.\r\r\nRectal use: Not recommend for prolonged CNS depression.\r\r\nInfants and Childrens:\r\r\nAnxiety: IM, IV: 0.04-0.3 mg/kg/dose q 2-4 h, max. 0.6 mg/kg within 8-hour period.\r\r\nConvulsive disorders:\r\r\nRectal use: Children 2-5 years: 0.5 mg/kg; 6-11 years: 0.3 mg/kg; ≧12 years and Adults: 0.2 mg/kg. (Note: < 20 mg/dose; q 4-12 h if needed; <5 times/month or <once every 5 days.)\r\r\nInfants >30 days and Children:\r\r\nIV: 0.1-0.3 mg/kg/dose for 3-5 min., q 5–10 min. (max: 10 mg/dose). Children≧5 years: IV: 1 mg slow I.V. every 2-5 min up to a max 10 mg; repeat in 2-4 hours if needed.",
      "兒童常用劑量說明": "Procedure sedation: 0.05-0.1mg/kg stat. Status epilepticus: Infant and Children: 0.1-0.4mg/kg (max. 10mg/dose) repeat q 5-10 minutes for 2-3 doses. \r\r\n[NICU/SBR]:IV bolus: 0.1-0.3 mg/kg over 3-5 mins q15-30min (Max total dose: 2 mg)",
      "貯藏方式": "<30℃",
      "用藥方法": "1.肌肉注射應注射到三角肌深部。最好是作靜脈注射，但要很緩慢。2.不可與其它溶液、靜脈輸注液或其他藥物混合或稀釋，且會被輸液袋及輸液管所吸附，因此本藥不宜作靜脈輸注。3.如果不能直接靜脈注射，也可緩慢注入輸液管內，但要盡量接近注射點（Insertion Point）。",
      "特別用藥指示": "1.如出現下列副作用，請與醫師聯繫：口腔或喉嚨持續潰瘍或疼痛；幻想或無法入睡或異常興奮、精神紊亂；皮疹或搔癢；喉痛及發燒。2.用藥期間請勿飲酒。3.懷孕期前三個月使用本藥會增加先天性畸型的危險。4.會分泌於乳汁中，哺乳母親使用本藥可能對嬰兒產生鎮靜作用、餵食困難與體重減輕。5.長期使用比正常劑量為大之劑量，可能會產生心理及身體依賴性。",
