      "兒童常用劑量說明": "ADHD: >8 yrs 2.5mg/day, Max 10mg/day\r\r\nAutism: 6-18 yrs initial 2mg/day for 7 days, Max. 15mg/day\r\r\nBipolar I disorder (acute manic or mixed episodes):  10-17 years: Initial: 2 mg qd for 2 days, followed by 5 mg qd for 2 days with a further increase to target dose of 10 mg qd. Max. 30 mg/day.\r\r\nTourette syndrome (6-18 yrs, <50 kg): Initial 2 mg qd for 2 days, then 5 mg qd; if tics not controlled, may increase to Max. 10 mg/day in intervals of not less than 1 week.\r\r\nTourette syndrome (6-18 yrs, ≧50 kg): Initial 2 mg qd for 2 days, then 5 mg qd for 5 days, on day 8 increase to 10 mg qd; if tics not controlled, may increase to Max. 20 mg/day in increments of 5 mg/day at intervals not less than 1 week.",
