      "成人常用劑量說明": "(健保每天限給付1粒)\r\r\nPO. Newly Diagnosed Multiple Myeloma: initial 25mg QD on days 1-21 of a 28-day treatment cycle.\r\r\nMyelodysplastic syndromes, combined therapy: initial 25mg QD on day 1-14 of a 21-day treatment cycle for  8 cycles, then 25mg QD on day 1-21 of a 28-day treatment cycle until disease progression or unacceptable toxicity.",
